 will only arrive at exactly one invocation.","docLink":"./Std/Sync/Channel.html#Std.CloseableChannel.forAsync","kind":"opaque","line":752,"name":"Std.CloseableChannel.forAsync","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Std/Sync/Channel.lean#L752-L761"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Sync/Channel.html#Std.CloseableChannel.recvSelector\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">CloseableChannel</span>.<span class=\"name\">recvSelector</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ch</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Sync/Channel.html#Std.CloseableChannel\">CloseableChannel</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Async/Select.html#Std.Async.Selector\">Async.Selector</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Creates a `Selector` that resolves once `ch` has data available and provides that data.\nIn particular if `ch` is closed while waiting on this `Selector` and no data is available already\nthis will resolve to `none`.","docLink":"./Std/Sync/Channel.html#Std.CloseableChannel.recvSelector","kind":"def","line":741,"name":"Std.CloseableChannel.recvSelector","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Std/Sync/Channel.lean#L741-L750"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Sync/Channel.html#Std.CloseableChannel.recv\">